OL,3,AAsia markets jump as Nvidia boss Jensen
OL,4,AHuang reinstated after spy scandal     
OL,6,FHuang stepped down earlier this month, 
OL,7,Fafter admitting an affair with a woman 
OL,8,Fwho was alleged to be a Chinese spy -  
OL,9,Fhe was also accused of an affair with  
OL,10,Fan Nvidia executive. Here's a timeline 
OL,11,Fof Huang's downfall - and return       
OL,13,FMeanwhile, the US Senate Banking       
OL,14,FCommittee announces Huang will testify 
OL,15,Fon 3 December; he has also been called 
OL,16,Fto appear before three House committees
OL,18,FTrump - who pushed for Huang's         
OL,19,Freinstatement - calls him a "great     
OL,20,Fpatriot" and says the US government has
OL,21,F"no reason to believe" his return poses
OL,22,Fa national security risk               
